  "source": "Hettich Lift Advanced HK assembly instruction (2012) and shop page: side drilling 3 × Ø5 × 12 for Euro screws at (22, 41), (118, 41), (75, 85) — from the front edge and below the underside of the top (read from the drawing); front: 2 × Ø10 × 12 per side for expansion sleeves, 15.5 from the side's inner face and B + 158 / B + 190 below the flap's top edge (B = flap top below the cabinet top) — positions read from a sketch, CHECK before machining; flap hinged at the top on cup hinges, at least 90 from the side; gas springs chosen by inside height and flap weight (table). See docs/hardware-research/hanging-flaps.json.",
